  "changes": [
    "Keep long constant levels in single PIO packets instead of splitting them into 20 ms refill deadlines.",
    "Record interrupts caught in timer/DMA callbacks so foreground wait raises them and stops output.",
    "Disable every owned DMA channel and its interrupts before aborting any channel in its chain.",
    "Clean up interrupted construction and waits, including captures and groups.",
    "Bound and compact streaming gate metadata; evict history before appending to avoid doubling allocation at entry 129.",
    "Preserve short float durations such as 0.01 ms at 100 kHz.",
    "Decode signed clock-divider register reads correctly for slow digital capture."
  ],
